    "When the fairgrounds season opens, Del Mar's population doesn't grow — it multiplies, and it multiplies overnight. Houses that hosted nobody since Labor Day host twelve people by Friday. Every appliance in town hits its annual peak load in the same two-week window, which is also exactly when a repair company with no local presence is hardest to book.",
